{"id":"n74103-14-7","stage":1,"title":"돌아가다 · 转","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74103-14-7-1","ko":"이 근처에 문구점이 있나요?","zh":"这附近有文具店吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"근처에","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처에","audio":"/audio/fd4c3e06470f8b90c75b.mp3"}},{"text":"문구점이","meaning":"文具店","explanation":"문구점：文具店；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문구점","audio":"/audio/96341b3bb6fb09e94efb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55304","senseId":"1","lemma":"문구점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문구점이","audio":"/audio/a1455ba1ea10c856750e.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e44b07ac25b977cc","term":"근처","zh":"附近，近处","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3","entryId":"62061","definition":"以某场所、东西或人为中心，较近的地方。","pronunciation":["근ː처"]},{"id":"96341b3bb6fb09e9","term":"문구점","zh":"文具店","audio":"/audio/96341b3bb6fb09e94efb.mp3","entryId":"55304","definition":"出售纸、铅笔、橡皮等学习或工作必需品的店铺。","pronunciation":["문구점"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ae87fbe63b3a3221c4d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74103-14-7-2","ko":"저 기둥을 끼고 돌아가면 바로 있어요.","zh":"沿着那根柱子绕过去就能看到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"기둥을","meaning":"柱子，支柱，廊柱","explanation":"기둥：柱子，支柱，廊柱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기둥","audio":"/audio/41876a9dc87dc7f9ffb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32498","senseId":"1","lemma":"기둥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기둥을","audio":"/audio/c66b523bda1827eb785c.mp3"}},{"text":"끼고","meaning":"沿着，依傍","explanation":"끼다：沿着，依傍；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61097","senseId":"4","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼고","audio":"/audio/9f3112402d255d7d87e7.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가면","meaning":"转，绕","explanation":"돌아가다：转，绕；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"14","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가면","audio":"/audio/9f85e4461ab1bdf895f2.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就。","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audi